function editionData(){return dataEdition==='forever'?[...foreverCorpus,...corpusForeverUndead,...corpusForeverTauren,...corpusForeverOrc,...corpusForeverDwarf].map(r=>({race:r.language==='인간어'?'인간(공용어)':r.language,inp:r.input,out:r.output,kind:r.kind,status:r.confidence,source:r.provenance})):classicRawData.concat(gnomeRawData,orcRawData,trollRawData,undeadRawData,nightelfRawData,draeneiRawData,highelfRawData,taurenRawData);}
function setDataEdition(value){dataEdition=value;for(const key of ['forever','classic']){const btn=el('dataEdition-'+key);btn.classList.toggle('active',key===value);btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(key===value));}renderRaw();}
function setTranslatorEdition(value){edition=value;try{localStorage.setItem("waca.edition",value);}catch(e){}syncRankingEdition(value);corpus=value==='forever'?(el('lang').value==='orc'?corpusForeverOrc:el('lang').value==='tauren'?corpusForeverTauren:el('lang').value==='dwarf'?corpusForeverDwarf:el('lang').value==='undead'?corpusForeverUndead:foreverCorpus):(el('lang').value==='undead'?corpusUndeadHypothesis:el('lang').value==='orc'?corpusOrc:el('lang').value==='troll'?corpusTroll:el('lang').value==='gnome'?corpusGnome:el('lang').value==='dwarf'?corpusDwarf:el('lang').value==='nightelf'?corpusNightelf:el('lang').value==='draenei'?corpusDraenei:el('lang').value==='highelf'?corpusHighelf:el('lang').value==='tauren'?corpusTauren:corpusClassic);for(const key of ['forever','classic']){const btn=el('translatorEdition-'+key);btn.classList.toggle('active',key===value);btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(key===value));}updateDirection(direction);refreshLanguageBadges();updateLanguage();} for(const key of ['forever','classic']){el('dataEdition-'+key).addEventListener('click',()=>setDataEdition(key));el('translatorEdition-'+key).addEventListener('click',()=>setTranslatorEdition(key));}
setTranslatorEdition(edition);
el('raceFilter').addEventListener('change',renderRaw);el('dataSearch').addEventListener('input',renderRaw);renderRaw();
